      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Heh— You were introduced to me by old man Hayden?\r\nYou want to know about the \"Seeker\"?\r\nSure, you're welcome.",
        "Jp" : "へえ――\r\nヘイデンのおっさんに紹介されたのか\r\n《シーカー》のこと知りたいってか？\r\nもちろん、歓迎するぜ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 255020,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well, the \"Seeker\" is characterized first of all\r\nby a quick succession of attacks using daggers—\r\nand then by three-dimensional\r\nmovement using ropes.",
        "Jp" : "そうだな、《シーカー》と言えばまずは\r\nダガ―を使った素早い連続攻撃――\r\nそれからロープを使った\r\n立体移動が特徴だな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 255371,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "For us, the rope is a part of our body, like a\r\nthird hand that extends freely!",
        "Jp" : "オレ達にとっちゃロープは体の一部\r\n自由に伸びる第三の手、みたいなモンさ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 255372,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Hit & Away, and above all, the romance of facing\r\noff against colossal monsters!",
        "Jp" : "ヒット＆アウェイ、そして何より\r\nデカイ魔物に取りつくロマン！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 255373,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It's like you're the wind chopping up your\r\nenemies, and it feels good, doesn't it?",
        "Jp" : "まるで自分が敵を切り刻む\r\n風にでもなったみたいで気持ちいいぞ？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 255374,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I'm Chester, and it's nice to meet you again.\r\nEnjoy the freedom of the Seeker's life!\r\nI'll be waiting for you to\r\ncomplete your assignments!",
        "Jp" : "オレはチェスター、あらためてよろしくな\r\n自由な《シーカー》生活を楽しんでみないか？\r\n課題のクリア、待ってるぜ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 255375,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
