      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It's about those who achieve their goals,\r\nunconstrained by the form of the path, by carving\r\ntheir own way forward.",
        "Jp" : "求めるものを手に入れるため\r\n道の形に縛られることなく\r\n目的を手繰り寄せる者のことなんだ"
