      "GmdIndex" : 19,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Oh, hey there!\r\nI must say, you've changed a lot since\r\nthe first time we met.",
        "Jp" : "おぉお、あんた！\r\n気がつけば、初めて会った時とは\r\n雰囲気が全然違うな"
