      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Let's see how high you can go.\r\nFrom now on, you're in a race against yourself.",
        "Jp" : "どれほどの高みを目指せるか\r\nこれからは自分との勝負になるぜ"
