      "GmdIndex" : 22,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ah, what am I doing?\r\nI'm called a \"Seeker,\" you know.\r\nAre you interested?",
        "Jp" : "ああ、オレのやってること？\r\n《シーカー》ってんだけどさ\r\n興味ある？"
