      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 26,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If you become knowledgeable about the valley to\r\nthe extent that even Hayden recognizes you, I\r\nthink you can aim for even greater\r\ntechniques as a Seeker.",
        "Jp" : "あんたがヘイデンのおっさんが認めるくらい\r\n渓谷に詳しくなれりゃ、《シーカー》として\r\n更なるテクも目指せると思うぜ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 493081,
